      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7820579d736c267",
      "translationZh": "原始数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0084ccfdfb5f7a17",
      "translationZh": "包含已处理数据的电子表格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb31ab2d63bc57b2",
      "translationZh": "我们希望帮助客户针对自己的用例，高效且以最优方式使用 LLMs 和 Llama 2。在深入讨论基准测试和数据之前，让我们先看看所使用的技术和方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
