    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f7603b6c58c6fa84",
      "translationZh": "最佳延迟部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94fb7fff4bc97a94",
      "translationZh": "最佳延迟配置可最大限度地缩短生成一个 token 所需的时间。低延迟对于实时用例以及为客户提供良好体验非常重要，例如聊天应用。我们考察了在 1 个并发请求下，每个 token 耗时（以毫秒计）的最低中位数。总体延迟最低的是在 ml.g5.12xlarge 实例上运行的 Llama 2 7B，为 16.8ms/token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3e4d9d8b7ebe9c2",
      "translationZh": "量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "425f233626b3cd02",
      "translationZh": "实例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c3431884e463944",
      "translationZh": "并发请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1c0799db06c2030",
      "translationZh": "延迟（ms/token）中位数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1d40336b310ae13",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量（tokens/second）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "390a16643fc40404",
      "translationZh": "us-west-2 中的按需成本（$/h）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5af071072c152c16",
      "translationZh": "生成 1 M tokens 所需时间（分钟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "509daa740893e6e3",
      "translationZh": "生成 1M tokens 的成本（$）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "26201645fb14d83d",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ceef356f08a221a4",
      "translationZh": "在这项基准测试中，我们在 Amazon SageMaker 上测试了 Llama 2 的 60 种配置。对于注重成本效益的部署，我们发现，采用 GPTQ 的 13B Llama 2 在 g5.2xlarge 上可达到每秒 71 个 token，每小时成本为 $1.55。对于最大吞吐量，13B Llama 2 在 ml.g5.12xlarge 上达到了每秒 296 个 token，每 1M 个 token 的成本为 $2.21。而对于最低延迟，7B Llama 2 在 ml.g5.12xlarge 上实现了每个 token 16ms 的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82c21fbbd0bd4e1f",
      "translationZh": "我们希望这项基准测试能帮助企业根据自身需求，以最优方式部署 Llama 2。如果您想开始在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署 Llama 2，请参阅《介绍适用于 Amazon SageMaker 的 Hugging Face LLM 推理容器》和《在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署 Llama 2 7B/13B/70B》这两篇博客文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d56adfaff91acdc",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如果你有任何问题，欢迎随时通过 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 联系我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
